{"id":"85b2b165e2a49e00","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-weak-operator-topology.md","title":"Relative Weak Operator Topology","display":"df-weak-operator-topology — Relative Weak Operator Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-weak-operator-topology","aliases":["58-df-weak-operator-topology","Weak Operator Topology"],"display":"df-weak-operator-topology — Relative Weak Operator Topology","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-topology-generated-by-subbase.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-weak-operator-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-weak-operator-topology</span><span>Weak Operator Topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-operator-topology — Relative Weak Operator Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a2b5fe4940e08b75\" href=\"?note=a2b5fe4940e08b75\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-topology-generated-by-subbase.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-topology-generated-by-subbase.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e61c089fc5e610a6\" href=\"?note=e61c089fc5e610a6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}}\\in V\">\\(B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}}\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is a supplied carrier of operators <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T:H\\to H\">\\(T:H\\to H\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S\n(\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}},B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\forall T\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal S=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\{T\\in B:\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\\in U\\}:\nx,y\\in H,\\ U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S(B,\\mathcal S,\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S\n(\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}},B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\forall T\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal S=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\{T\\in B:\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\\in U\\}:\nx,y\\in H,\\ U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{9em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S(B,\\mathcal S,\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S\n(T_\\bullet,T,D,\\leq_D,B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D,\\leq_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_\\bullet,D,B)\n\\land T\\in B\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall S\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists d_0\\in D\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle d_0,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl|\n\\langle T_\\bullet(d)(x),y\\rangle-\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\n\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S\n(T_\\bullet,T,D,\\leq_D,B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D,\\leq_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_\\bullet,D,B)\n\\land T\\in B\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall S\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\exists d_0\\in D\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle d_0,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl|\n\\langle T_\\bullet(d)(x),y\\rangle-\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\n\\bigr|&lt;\\varepsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operator carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, Hilbert inner product, and ordinary topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span> are explicit. If <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\mathcal B(H)\">\\(B=\\mathcal B(H)\\)</span>, this is the usual weak operator topology.</li>\n<li>The convergence clause expands the net limit into the directed eventuality condition and therefore does not depend on an unbound meta-level limit symbol.</li>\n<li>Bounded linearity of every member of a particular chosen <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is a separate certificate; this atom does not silently construct <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(H)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kadison and Ringrose, Fundamentals of the Theory of Operator Algebras</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-topology-generated-by-subbase.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2b5fe4940e08b75","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-top7-topology-generated-by-subbase.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"e61c089fc5e610a6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-directed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C},\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"T:H\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{WeakOperatorTopology}_S\n(\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}},B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathbb C,\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\n\\land\\forall T\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(T,H,H)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal S=\n\\Bigl\\{\n\\{T\\in B:\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\\in U\\}:\nx,y\\in H,\\ U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb C}\n\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{9em}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7TopologyGeneratedBySubbase}_S(B,\\mathcal S,\\tau_{\\mathrm{WOT}})\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}operator\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{WOTConverges}_S\n(T_\\bullet,T,D,\\leq_D,B,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle)\n\\land\\mathrm{Directed}_S(D,\\leq_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T_\\bullet,D,B)\n\\land T\\in B\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall S\\in B\\;\\mathrm{Function}(S,H,H)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in H\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\n\\exists d_0\\in D\\;\\forall d\\in D\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\langle d_0,d\\rangle\\in\\leq_D\\\\\n&\\hspace{11em}{}\\to\n\\bigl|\n\\langle T_\\bullet(d)(x),y\\rangle-\\langle T(x),y\\rangle\n\\bigr|<\\varepsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\mathcal B(H)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(H)","display":false}],"bytes":2867,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1378","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-weak-operator-topology.md|58-df-weak-operator-topology]